{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"一、五年，春正月甲戌己丑，陳侯鮑卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"曷為以二日？卒之怴也。甲戌之日亡，己丑之日死而得，君子疑焉，故以二日卒之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊侯、鄭伯如紀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"外相如不書，此何以書？離不言會也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"三、天王使仍叔之子來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"仍叔之子者何？天子之大夫也。其稱仍叔之子何？譏。何譏爾？譏父老子代從政也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"四、葬陳桓公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"五、城祝丘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"六、秋，蔡人、衞人、陳人從王伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"其言從王伐鄭何？正也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"七、大雩。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"大雩者何？旱祭也。然則何以不言旱？言雩則旱見；言旱則雩不見。何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"八、〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"九、冬，州公如曹。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_16_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_16","textTraditional":"外相如不書，此何以書？過我也。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}